WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.143
Find the operation connecting consecutive terms. Use the same step to extend the

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:06.664
sequence and justify it.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:15.566
Continue: 19, 21, 23, ... What is term 8? The answer is 33. Term 8 is 19 plus 7 times

00:00:15.566 --> 00:00:16.771
2 equals 33.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.887
The values 2, 12, 22 describe a pattern in the class garden. What is the value at

00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:26.918
step 8 (counting the first as step 1)? Pause the video and think.

00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:33.381
The values 2, 12, 22 describe a pattern in the class garden. What is the value at

00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:39.967
step 8 (counting the first as step 1)? The answer is 72. Term 8 is 2 plus 7 times 10

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:40.626
equals 72.
